<view class="exports-page {{viewportClass}}"><view class="mini-header" style="{{shellHeaderStyle}}"><view class="header-back" hover-class="is-pressed" aria-role="button" aria-label="返回更多工具" bindtap="handleBack"><image src="/assets/icons/web-chevron-left.svg" mode="aspectFit" /></view><view class="header-title"><text class="header-title-main">导出排班与统计</text><text class="header-title-sub">登录态下载 · 仅当前群组</text></view><text class="phase-chip">P9</text></view><scroll-view class="exports-scroll" style="{{pageScrollStyle}}" scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="page-content"><view wx:if="{{state === 'disabled'}}" class="page-state-card insights-disabled"><view class="state-mark">—</view><text class="state-title">导出暂未开放</text><text class="state-copy">当前版本未开启 insights 能力，不会创建导出任务或下载文件。</text></view><view wx:else class="exports-content"><view class="page-heading"><text class="section-eyebrow">离线文件 / 安全导出</text><text class="page-title">导出排班与统计</text><text class="page-description">文件通过登录态下载，不在 URL 中携带 token；生成期间可以安全离开页面。</text></view><view class="surface-card"><view class="card-header"><view><text class="card-title">导出内容</text><text class="card-subtitle">当前月份 · {{exportType === 'statistics' ? '统计' : '排班'}}</text></view><text class="phase-chip">CSV</text></view><view class="field-block"><text class="field-label">文件类型</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{['排班', '统计']}}" value="{{exportType === 'statistics' ? 1 : 0}}" bindchange="handleTypeChange"><view class="native-picker">{{exportType === 'statistics' ? '统计' : '排班'}}</view></picker></view><view class="export-summary"><text class="summary-label">当前月份</text><text class="summary-value">{{currentMonthLabel}}</text><text class="summary-note">按当前群组权限生成，过期文件由服务端清理。</text></view><ui-button wx:if="{{state === 'idle' || state === 'error'}}" variant="primary" label="创建导出任务" bindpress="handleCreate"></ui-button><ui-button wx:elif="{{state === 'waiting'}}" variant="secondary" label="正在准备导出" loading="{{true}}" disabled="{{true}}"></ui-button><view wx:elif="{{state === 'ready'}}" class="ready-result"><text class="ready-title">导出已完成</text><text class="ready-file">{{fileLabel}}</text><ui-button variant="primary" label="下载文件" bindpress="handleDownload"></ui-button><ui-button variant="secondary" label="重新开始" bindpress="handleReset"></ui-button></view></view><view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}"><ui-alert tone="danger" title="导出任务未完成" message="{{errorMessage}}"></ui-alert></view><view class="security-note"><text class="security-title">下载安全</text><text>临时文件只交给当前页面打开，不保存到相册、不写入业务缓存。</text></view><view class="bottom-spacer"></view></view></view></scroll-view></view>
